#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:4
msgid "v3.6.9"
msgstr "v3.6.9"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.6.9 brings **WiFi to the Arduino Portenta H7** — the LWIP networking "
"stack and Cypress CYW43 drivers were added and WiFi was enabled — along with"
" external-flash storage init and a batch of Portenta clock/memory and "
"networking stability fixes. It introduces **no breaking API changes** — "
"v3.6.8 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v3.6.9 membawa **WiFi ke Arduino Portenta H7** — stack jaringan LWIP dan "
"driver Cypress CYW43 ditambahkan serta WiFi diaktifkan — beserta "
"inisialisasi penyimpanan flash eksternal dan serangkaian perbaikan "
"stabilitas clock/memori serta jaringan pada Portenta. Rilis ini **tidak "
"mengubah API** — skrip v3.6.8 berjalan tanpa perubahan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Pada halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Portenta H7 WiFi** — LWIP stack and Cypress CYW43 WiFi drivers added and "
"WiFi enabled, with a separate CYW43 firmware image shipped in the release."
msgstr ""
"**WiFi Portenta H7** — stack LWIP dan driver WiFi Cypress CYW43 ditambahkan "
"dan WiFi diaktifkan, dengan citra firmware CYW43 terpisah yang disertakan "
"dalam rilis."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:22
msgid ""
"**External-flash storage** — storage is now initialized on boards with "
"external flash, plus a memory-mapped external-flash region."
msgstr ""
"**Penyimpanan flash eksternal** — penyimpanan kini diinisialisasi pada board"
" dengan flash eksternal, beserta wilayah flash eksternal yang dipetakan ke "
"memori."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Stability** — Portenta clock/memory (FMC/SDRAM, QSPI, PLL1) and networking"
" init/de-init fixes."
msgstr ""
"**Stabilitas** — perbaikan inisialisasi/de-inisialisasi clock/memori "
"(FMC/SDRAM, QSPI, PLL1) dan jaringan pada Portenta."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:26
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v3.6.8 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Tidak ada perubahan API yang merusak** — reflash dan skrip v3.6.8 Anda "
"berjalan tanpa perubahan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:30
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Fitur baru"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Portenta H7 WiFi** — added the LWIP library and CYW43 drivers (LWIP and "
"CYW43 submodules), enabled WiFi on the Portenta, generated a separate CYW43 "
"firmware image, and added the CYW4343 firmware binary to the release "
"deliverables."
msgstr ""
"**WiFi Portenta H7** — menambahkan pustaka LWIP dan driver CYW43 (submodul "
"LWIP dan CYW43), mengaktifkan WiFi pada Portenta, menghasilkan citra "
"firmware CYW43 terpisah, dan menambahkan biner firmware CYW4343 ke "
"deliverable rilis."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:36
msgid ""
"**External flash** — storage is now initialized on boards with external "
"flash, with a configurable linker section for the CYW43 firmware and a "
"memory-mapped external-flash region."
msgstr ""
"**Flash eksternal** — penyimpanan kini diinisialisasi pada board dengan "
"flash eksternal, dengan bagian linker yang dapat dikonfigurasi untuk "
"firmware CYW43 dan wilayah flash eksternal yang dipetakan ke memori."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:41
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Perubahan dan perbaikan lainnya"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:43
msgid ""
"Used the highest-priority MPU region for DMA buffers and added the CYW43 / "
"LWIP initialization paths in ``main``."
msgstr ""
"Menggunakan wilayah MPU prioritas tertinggi untuk buffer DMA dan menambahkan"
" jalur inisialisasi CYW43 / LWIP di ``main``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:47
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:49
msgid "Portenta and memory:"
msgstr "Portenta dan memori:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:51
msgid ""
"Fixed the Portenta FMC/SDRAM and QSPI PLL settings, the QSPI prescaler, the "
"QSPI MPU config, and PLL1."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki pengaturan PLL FMC/SDRAM dan QSPI pada Portenta, prescaler QSPI,"
" konfigurasi MPU QSPI, dan PLL1."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:54
msgid "Networking and system:"
msgstr "Jaringan dan sistem:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:56
msgid ""
"Fixed the WiFi initialization functions, added the missing LWIP/CYW43 "
"initialization in ``main``, called network de-init in ``main``, fixed SDIO "
"DMA transfers, the USBDBG IRQn bug, and de-init the I2C bus before re-"
"initializing it."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki fungsi inisialisasi WiFi, menambahkan inisialisasi LWIP/CYW43 "
"yang hilang di ``main``\\ , memanggil de-init jaringan di ``main``\\ , "
"memperbaiki transfer DMA SDIO, bug USBDBG IRQn, dan de-init bus I2C sebelum "
"menginisialisasinya kembali."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:62
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Dukungan hardware dan board"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Arduino Portenta H7** — WiFi (CYW43 / LWIP) and external-flash storage."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Portenta H7** — WiFi (CYW43 / LWIP) dan penyimpanan flash "
"eksternal."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:67
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Perubahan API yang merusak"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.9.rst:69
msgid ""
"v3.6.9 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v3.6.8 run unchanged on v3.6.9 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v3.6.9 **tidak memperkenalkan perubahan Python API yang merusak**\\ . Skrip "
"yang berjalan pada v3.6.8 berjalan tanpa perubahan pada v3.6.9 — cukup "
"reflash firmware."
